e":"h","text":"Best Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A highly competitive B.Des Toy & Game Design graduate should be able to demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Strong product-design fundamentals","child-centred design","play mechanics","CAD/3D modelling","physical prototyping","manufacturing awareness","safety awareness","user testing","5–7 strong toy projects","internship experience","AI/interactive toy knowledge."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The key differentiator is not simply creating attractive toy concepts. A strong Toy Designer can turn an idea into a safe, engaging, age-appropriate, testable and manufacturable product."}]}]}